  "title": "Q024 문제 풀이 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 024</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>24 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"24번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:22%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q024\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q024\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">이전 문제 <b>Q023</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">다음 문제 <b>Q025</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
